<!--
  Shape A: the textbook CAMT.053.001.08.

  OPBD/CLBD balances, FrToDt present, one TxDtls per entry, ISO transaction
  codes with domain, family and sub-family, structured remittance with a
  referenced document. The shape every implementation is tested against and
  the one roughly one bank in four actually sends.
-->
